'''Gorilliam''' (ゴリ男氏 ''Gorio-shi'') is an [[:Category:Alien Enemies|Alien]] enemy introduced in [[Forbidden Bride Pt II (Monthly Event)|Forbidden Bride Pt II]]. He was added in [[Version 7.1 Update|Version 7.1]].

