==Enemy==
This enemy is similar to [[Gory Groom]], except with more health, less damage and fewer knockbacks. He also gains the ability to warp your cats. With his rapid attack rate, he can break through your defenses easily.

==Strategy==
[[:Category:Cats with Freeze ability|Cat Units with freeze abilities]] ([[Surfer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Surfer Cat]], [[Balaluga (Uber Rare Cat)|Balalan Pasalan]], [[Akira (Uber Rare Cat)|Akira]], etc.) can do wonders as they can stop him from destroying your front lines and warping them back. [[:Category:Cats with Warp Immunity|Cats with Warp Immunity]] can not be Warped and therefore prevent Gorilliam from pushing through your lines, or at least slow him down.

When Gorilliam is given higher buffs in later stages, Cats with Warp Immunity start to become useless, as his damage is enough to kill or knockback most meatshields in 1 hit, in which case it is best to just use [[Psychocat (Rare Cat)|Psychocat]] or Surfer Cat to stop him from moving forward. [[:Category:Anti-Alien Cats|Anti-Alien Cats]] with Massive Damage/Insane Damage (except for [[Wheel Cat (Rare Cat)|Chill Cat]] because of poor range) could also help to make quick work of Gorilliam.

