==Trivia==
*His Japanese name, Gorio-shi (ゴリ男氏), may be a pun on ''gorioshi'' (鮴押し), a slang term meaning "to do something with force or pressure".
*Due to a bug in the [[Version 10.6 Update]], Gorilliam's name in French was "[[Gory]] Alien". Alien is his trait, but the word alien appears nowhere in his name, rather being a portmanteau of ''gorilla'' and ''William''.
*Gorilliam, [[Satan Claus]], [[Bears Be Back]] and [[Commander Ostromeda]] are the only [[:Category:Unstarred Alien Enemies|unstarred Aliens]] with the Warp ability.
**Commander Ostromeda is the only one to have a description and the only one who was not introduced in a Lucky Ticket G event.

